	(text "AQOR ORP front-end test bench (simulation only; nothing here is on the board).\nMirrors hardware/orp_amp.kicad_sch: same refs and values for R1-R4, C14 and D2 (C10 is DNP there, so absent here);\nR104/D102 copy R4/D2 for the fault case: V4 holds U2B_OUT at -4.8 V (U2B saturated negative);\nU201/U202 are U2 sections A/B (TL072HIDR; simulated with the TI SLOJ067 TL072 macromodel in models/).\nStimulus: V1/V2 stand in for +5V and the TPS60400 -5V rail (ideal);\nV3 + R100 are the ORP probe: an EMF behind 100 Mohm, on the BNC centre (J2 SIGNAL). SW2 open.\nORP_IN goes to the Nano's A0 (A1 pin 19), through R4.\nD2/D102 use the Nexperia BAT54 SPICE model (models/bat54.lib).\nChecks: expect.toml, run by check.py."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 25.4 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "89188b5f-ceb1-5a40-b500-e8d20734f809")
	)
